{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NEW DEMO UPLOADED!!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Highly Advanced Future in 2099</h2><br>Thanks to the remarkable advancements in science and technology, humanity has finally achieved the implementation of &quot;Full-Dive&quot; technology. With &quot;Full-Dive,&quot; individuals can vividly experience events they have never personally encountered.<br><br>For instance, even without physically going to Disneyland, one can immerse themselves in the experience through data chips provided by someone who has been there and enjoy a lifelike &quot;Full-Dive.&quot;<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447130/extras/\ub2ec\ub9ac\uae30.gif?t=1740547850\" /><br><br>Our game, &quot;Veiled Edge,&quot; tells the story of investigator Rapid and his junior partner Lena as they delve into various issues taking place in the state of &quot;Full-Dive.&quot;<br><br>&quot;Veiled Edge&quot; is a hacking action platformer set in a virtual reality world. The abilities of the protagonist, Rapid, also vary depending on the world he dives into. In the demo version, Rapid can activate &quot;Shift,&quot; allowing him to teleport instantly.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447130/extras/\uc21c\uac04\uc774\ub3d9.gif?t=1740547850\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447130/extras/\uae30\ucc28.gif?t=1740547850\" /><br><br>Utilize Rapid's diverse abilities to eliminate enemies and unravel problems by hacking the levels with the powerful hacking skills of Lena.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447130/extras/\uc804\ud22c.gif?t=1740547850\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447130/extras/\ub9c8\uc9c0\ub9c9.